{0 awskit-lwt-unix}

Ready-to-use Lwt + Unix runtime adapter for Awskit.

The public entrypoint is {!module:Awskit_lwt_unix}. This package wires the
generic Lwt runtime to Cohttp Lwt Unix and the standard Unix credential and
region sources.

Use it at the application edge when a Lwt service client should load AWS
configuration from environment variables, shared profile files, or supported
metadata sources.
